<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">OFL - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Ofilipiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba OFILIPIYA</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ofilipiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ofili</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa Enzu Umba</para>
  <para style="mt1">OFILIPIYA</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu ungwu Ofilipiya kwɔlɛ o ka laa ɔshɔshi uwu kwonze uwu bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu a bɔ mu ɛzhi iyi Omasidoniya mu ɛzhi iyi Oromu. O ka ngwu kwuyengwu Ɔpɔlu e yi mu ugu igbomo mu Oromu. Anya iyi bɔkɔ wa wo ɛduma iyi Ukpo umbafo o wo iyi Ɔpɔlu mbala ɛzɔ iyangba iyi i yi mu ɔshɔshi mu kwuse ungwu Ofilipayi kwuye kwɔngu i shi Ɔpɔlu ubu ugyi gyɔɔ. Tetete kwupu kwɔlɛ kwu zɔ ɔnyɛ uwu Ɔpɔlu mbala egbo ikpɛnyi iyi e yi yi kwuwongu ikwidufulo iyɛkwu iyi e yi yi mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔpɔlu a zɔ idɛnyi iyɛkuu iyi e yi yi laa Wambwalu umba Ofilipiya mu kwupu kwɔlɛ. A gbɛlɛ mba ɛnyi kwuwongu idɛnyi iyi ɔ zɔ wu mbala imbwama mba kwuyengwu Ɔpɔlu e yi mu inyashi imama. A kamba ɛnwu ma te lo rima ngiri mu imbwaluma, lo nyama kaa inyashi iyi e yi mu imama mbala inyashi iyi mba o yi mu imama li gbamba kembo mo. A kpa mba ɛshɛku te lo yi egbo iyi oloto kyamate Ɔzhizɔsi tayi, lo nyama kaa igyɛmɛmi mbala ibɔma li to mbo egbo mo mo. E lolo mbo tee ilomesu iyi kwunyɔ mba mbala Okrasi akwu rɛshi ingyi esheshi iyi Ukpo iyi o na kwuwongu ikwidufulo mbo, moo akwu kwuwongu imbwaluma iyi Ɛrama iyi Azhu mo. E so iso meka iyi ɔnyɛ mbala egbinoma iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi enzu umba bɔkɔ o lomesu mbala Okrasi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwupu kwɔlɛ kwu shi ɔlu mu iso iyi ɔnyɛ mbala egbo ikpɛnyi mbala ikyo ewo mbala esu mbala idiyimo mu luzɛ undu umbwalu Okrasi. Kwu kyo kwu zɔ idɛnyi iyɛkwu iyi bɔkɔ Ɔpɔlu e yi yi laa Ɔshɔshi uwu Ofilipayi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Apula Iyi Bɔkɔ I Yi Mɛmi</para>
  <para style="ip">Kambu Iyemo (1.1 - 11)</para>
  <para style="ip">Imama iyi Ɔpɔlu meka iyi iŋɔma mu kwudu kwɔlɛ (1.12 - 26)</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwunyɔ mu Okrasi (1.27 - 2.18)</para>
  <para style="ip">Otimoti mbala Epafuroditu (2.19 - 30)</para>
  <para style="ip">Igboshoshi mbaa agewa mbala kumbɛ (3.1 -4.9)</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔpɔlu mbala ɛmɛza wu umba Ofilipiya (4.10 - 20)</para>
  <para style="ip">Imbwama iyi iso (4.21 - 23)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="ms">Kwupwu Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka A Ka Laa Enzu Umba Ofilipiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Kwupwu kwɔlɛ kwu ngyi mbaa nzu, Imi Ɔpɔlu mbala Otimoti ɛmɛgba umba Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi. Ki ka</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Laa enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi mu Ofilipayi umba bɔkɔ o kyomesu mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi, ikyo wa to keyi mbala wambwa mba ma:<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Ete nzu Ukpo mbala Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le shi yi esheshi mbala egbo mɛzhi.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu A Lɛ Ukpo Laa Wambwalu Umba O Wa Kwupu Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Kwuye ungwunanguna bɔkɔ mi byi egbo yi de mi gbɛlɛ Ukpo mi ɛnyi; <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />akwɛyi kwuyengwunanguna bɔkɔ mi lɛ Ukpo laa yi lɛɛbi de, mii lɛ laa ɔnyɛ makɔ <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />kwuwongu lu mbwa mi ma mu ɛduma iyi iso iyi Ukpo ngbaa mu ɔnuwu kwonze nzhii ba kwuye kwɔlɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Imi mi yitu laa egbo mi lɛɛbi tee, Ukpo uwu e ye laa ɛduma iyesheshi ɛlɛ iwomo ma yi awu, ee le ye mu iwomo nzhii ba aa mbwa yi ma ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi a ba gbama. <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />Lunyi lu yi mu egbo mi kwuyengwunanguna! Mi ngbomo mo tabɔkɔ mi byi egbo ɛlɛ te ma yi; moo lu lo ewo mbala mi mu esheshi ɛlɛ iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mi, laa kekelele bɔkɔ mi yi mu ugugyi ele mbala kwuyengwu mi gɔ iyami mu enzu epwu igbama mbala izɔma tee iso iyesheshi ɛlɛ akwu ongbulolo. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Ukpo gba akwu u uzɔgɔ mi le tee ongbulolo gba mi yi mu isomo le tee Imi mi pwu idɛnyi yi kyamate Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi mafyi wu e pwu idɛnyi yi tayi.<verse eid="PHP 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Mii lɛ Ukpo tee idɛnyi li le mu ikyikyomo, mbala iyitu mbala apula izɔngɔma marimari, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />kaa la lu yitu iyi bɔkɔ isheshi ika le. Ɛlɛ ii shi luu kwu enzu sɛsɛsɛ umba bɔkɔ o yi kwuto mo ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu Okrasi a ba gbama awu. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Akwɛyi luu yi ari iyesheshi shɛ, iyi bɔkɔ Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi kɛɛkyi gba ee shi le kaa Ukpo la fya inzumbɛku mbala iduma ma.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okrasi Gba Akwu Kwunyɔ Le</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, mi gyi te la lu yitu tee apula iyi bɔkɔ i du mi ele i mbwama gyɔɔ la ishekeyi iyi iso iyi Ukpo. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, wagbomo umba kwogba ungwu ɔsu mbala enzu umba o yi munɛ lɛɛbi o yitu tee o ta mi mu ugugyi kwuwongu bɔkɔ mi kwu Umɛgba uwu Okrasi le. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Itama mi mu ugugyi ɛlɛ, i ka ɛmɛnɛ mi wa mbwalu Ɔkwu ɛnwu ma gyɔɔ akwɛyi kwuyengwunanguna o tanu iyi iso iyi Ukpo laa iyi fo.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Ongbulolo gba e yi tee umbafo mba oo tanu iyi Okrasi kwuwongu rise mbala i gyi ovyo iwomo, umbafo ba o wo mu egbo iyeshi. <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />Enzu mbɔlɛ te o wo kwuwongu o pwu idɛnyi mi, moo o yitu tee o ta mi munɛ kwuwongu bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi mi ɛduma iyi igbomo iyi iso iyesheshi ɛlɛ le. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Uzhi uwu kwonze o tanu iyi Okrasi la egbo ikpɛnyi mo, oo tanu iyi Okrasi kwuwo ungwɛmba; oo ma kyamate umba oo kyo mi inyashi ma kwuye ngwɔlɛ bɔkɔ mi yi mu ugugyi ele.<verse eid="PHP 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Ɛlɛ ba akwu kiya kinyinyi mo! Mi yi mu ɔnyɛ imuma kwuwo ngwɔlɛ. Ɔnyɛ mi gba e yi te, mu ɔgwuzɛ uwunawuna o yi mu anu itama iyi Okrasi - laa egbo iyeshi loo, laa egbo iyira. Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mii so wu mu ɔnyɛ imuma, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />kwuwongu mi yitu tee, Ukpo ilɛma yi mbala imbwama iyi bɔkɔ ii ngyi mbaa Kwundu uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi awu, ii shi oo wa mi ma mu ugu ugyi. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Igyi kpɔ mi mbala eyi ifulomo mi gba akwu te la mi fɔma mu ɛduma mi iwomo mo, mi ba gyi te kwuyengwunanguna, egbo mi li kɔma kaa Okrasi la fya iduma kwuwo mi, shi mi yi kwunyɔ, shi mi yi kpomo mo. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Moo kwunyɔ akwu mbɛ? Munyi mi, kwunyɔ akwu Okrasi. lukwu ba akwu kule. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Gba akwiyi mi ye la kwunyɔ, de ba i zɔ te mii wo ɛduma iyesheshi mii kyo. Inyete mi yitu iyi bɔkɔ mi mulɛ mo. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Egbo mi i kama epo. Igyima mi iyɛku gba i yi tee la mi lafya la kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa la mi yi mbala Okrasi. Ɛlɛ i shi i ka le gyɔɔ; <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />tetete, kwuwo yi, i sheshi i ka tee la mi yi la kwunyɔ bɛnɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Imi mi nyama la egbo mi lɛɛbi te, te gba i yi le. Imi mii yi mbala yi lɛɛbi, kaa ɔnyɛ yi mbala ikwu idu lu fulo yi li kyomo, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />kaa kwuwongu iyimo mi mbala yi kpɔ, ii shi luu yi kwuyi ungwu esheshi ungwu lu kwu ɛnwu ma mi mu iwomo yi mu luzɛ mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Kekelele, iyi bɔkɔ i sheshi i ka gba i yi tee la lu zɛ luzɛ undu bɔkɔ iso iyesheshi iyi Okrasi i gyi, kaa shi mi fya kapa mi ka munyi yi, naa mi fya kapa mi ka munyi yi mo, la mi pwa tee lu rima ngiri laa egbo ikpɛnyi mu ewa ikirimo kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo iyi iso iyi esheshi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />La lu wiyi iyi agewa yi mo; la lu kɔ egbo ma kwuyengwunanguna, akwɛyi ɛlɛ i zɔ mba te umba o fɔma lunyi ba lu shiri mba ma moo Ukpo gba e shi yi ekpasu le. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Moo kapa unga Ukpo e shi yi ele akwu kaa la lu wo ɛduma laa Okrasi, akwu kwuwongu ikwu idu fulo ma wu kɛɛkyi mo, i kyo kaa la lu ma inyashi kwuwo wu tete. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />La lu kyo ewo mbala mi mu ewa itomo ɛlɛ. Akwu ewa ɛlɛ tete gba lu ma mi mu itomo mekyi le, inyi gba mi degbo mu itomo kyamate bɔkɔ lu pwa awu.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Igyi Ɛnwu ma Iyi Okrasi Mbala inzumbɛku Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Lunyi lu fya ɛnwu ɛkɔ ma kwuwongu lu kwu umba Okrasi, akwɛyi idɛnyi wu i gbo yi idu mo. Lu yi ikyomesu mbala Kwundu uwu Ukpo, akwɛyi lu yi ari iyeshi mbala eyembembyi iyesu. <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, amasa yi lakwu ikpɛnyi, idɛnyi yi lakwu ikpɛnyi, la lu kwu wakpɛnyi mu kwundu mbala egbo ibyima yi kaa ɔnyɛ mi la nyɔlɔma. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />La lu wo kiya ingyinangyina kwuwongu imɛyɛyi nana ɛnwu ikwumo mo, lunyi ba la lu gyi ɛnwu yi ma, la lu to enzu umbafo tee, o shi ka o ka yi ma. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ la lu yese mbesu, uwewe le yese mbaa esheshi iya wu byi mo. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Ari iyi bɔkɔ Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi e yi yi awu gba la lu yi yi le tete:<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Uwu e yi kya ta Ukpo tayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">tetete e to te mega aa masa ɛnwu mbala Ukpo mo.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Uwu ba e to ɛnwu te akwu kiya kinyinyi te mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">akwɛyi a ra la ɛnwu e wo umɛgba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">E to ɛnwu kyamate onzu tayi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">akwɛyi e bo mu ɛnwu iyi onzu.<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Tabɔkɔ e yi mu ɛnwu iyi onzu awu, a gyi ɛnwu ma akwɛyi e lomo nzhii ba lukwu wu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">E kpomo mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ Ukpo e shi wu kwunzu ungwu kwu ki ka le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">akwɛyi e shi wu ɛnyi iyi bɔkɔ i ka ɛnyi iyinayina ma.<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />Kwuwongwu inzumbɛku iyi ɛnyi iyi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">epunu lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ i yi moshi laa iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ laa iyi bɔkɔ i yi mɛzhi kindo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">i kwumo mu idu iyi Ɔzhizɔsi,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />akwɛyi lɛɛbi mba o so gedegede tee, Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi akwu Ɔkwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">akwɛyi Ada Ukpo aa fya iduma ma.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ilemo Mate Ɛbɛ Mu Kwudu Kwɔlɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ, ɛmɛza mi, kyamate bɔkɔ lu koko lu lo mi mo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ mi yi mbala yi awu, kekelele bɔkɔ mi yi mbala yi fo le lala ilomo yi li ka le ŋa. La lu so wu mu ɛduma iwomo la iyi mbala ipwuluma kaa isama yi li nyɔlɔma, <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />moo Ukpo e yi mu ɛduma iwomo mu ma yi iyɔkpɔɔ kaa la lu yi egbo kaa la lu lomo la iyi bɔkɔ uwu a gyi awu.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ lu wo li yi ezhini nana kaambu mo,<verse eid="PHP 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14I" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14I" />Iyinayina iyi bɔkɔ lu wo li yi ɛzhini mbala kaambu u mo<verse eid="PHP 2:14I" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />kaa la lu kwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo umba bɔkɔ o yi sɛkɛnɛ mbala sɛsɛ, umba bɔkɔ o yi meka iyi enzu umba ingbomo mbala itutumo umba kwudu kwɔlɛ La lu lemo meka mba kyamate elovyo bɔkɔ i lemo moshi tayi, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />akwɛyi la lu kyo lu zɛ mba ɛlɔgbulɔ iyi kwunyɔ. Gba lu wo tayi, mii fya kwuyi ungwu bɔkɔ mi kwɛnwu ma yi ɔnuwu Kwɔfyi ungwu igbama ungwu Okrasi, moo ɛlɛ i zɔ tee ebirigo mi mbala ɛduma mi akwu shaa mo.<verse eid="PHP 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Imi mi ma inyashi ba mi rala ɛnzhi mi mi wo isabɔ laa Ukpo kyamate bɔkɔ lunyi tete lu ma inyashi kwuwongu ikwu idu lu fulo yi awu. Gba akwu tayi, Imi mi mwɔnyɛ mbala yi lɛɛbi. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Lunyi tete la lu mwɔnyɛ, la lu zɔ ɔnyɛ yi ma mbala mi.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otimoti Mbala Ɛpafɔrɔditu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Gba Ɔkwu a nyama, mi yi egbo tee mi lɔ Otimoti ma munyi yi para, ka laa mi pwa ɛza yi iyi ɔnyɛ kaa li ka mi ɛnwu ma. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Uwu kɛɛkyi gba e yi egbo kyaa mbala mi le, gba ba a bɔ eyi shɛ mbaa yi le. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Umba bɔkɔ o shi mo le, uwewe a bɔ idu mu kiya ingya wu, moo akwu mu kiya ingyi Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mo. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Lunyi mafyi yi ba lu yitu tee Otimoti a bɔ ngiri a zɔ ɛnwu ma, kyamate umɛ mbala ada tayi, uwu mbala mi ki wo ɛduma kyaa kwuwongu iso iyesheshi ɛlɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi yi egbo tee mi lɔ wu ma munyi yi para mizhikembo iyi mi yitu iyi bɔkɔ i bi du mi. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Imi ba mi fulo idu mu Ɔkwu tee, i to kwuye gyɔɔ mo akwɛyi Imi mafyi mi mi nyɔ mi ma yi.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Imi mi ka amasa tee, ifate kaa la mi lɔ umanyi nzu Ɛpafɔrɔditu ma munyi yi, uwu e wo ɛduma ba e gbo ebirigo kya mbala mi, bɔkɔ lu lɔ wu ma kaa la mbwami ma awu. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />E yi mu ibɔkpɔ te la ma yi, egbo wu ba i nɔma mo kwuwongu lu pwa tee a nɔ ofya. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Iyesheshi a pwu ofya akwɛyi i shi bwɛɛ kaa le kpomo. Ukpo ba a ma eyembembyi wu, akwu uwu kɛɛkyi mo, i kyo mi tete, kaa la mi ma ubugyi uwu bɔkɔ a ka te mo mo. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, Imi mi yi mu igyakpɔɔ kaa mi lɔ wu le so munyi yi, kaa la lu gba la ɔnyɛ imuma kwuyengwu bɔkɔ lu ma wu, akwɛyi ubwu ugyi mi ee bomo. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />La lu na wu laa ɔnyɛ kwuwongu akwu u mbwalu uwu Ɔkwu. Enzu mbɔlɛ te lɛɛbi kyamate uwu te, lo lo mbo mo, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />kwuwongu e to kwunyɔ wu e shi, akwɛyi i shi bwɛ kaa le kpomo kwuwongu ɛduma iyi Okrasi, kwuwongu kaa la mbwa mi ma mu iyi bɔkɔ lu do yi iwomo awu.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="s">Ototo Shɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Mu imbwama yi, ɛmɛnɛ mi la lu mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu ilomesu yi mbala Ɔkwu. Mi yi aka mo gba mi gbala iso iyi mi ka yi mekyi awu ikama, kwuwongu iso ɛlɛ ii gbo yi mo. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />La lu ngbɛndu mbaa enzu umbira mbamba, izu mbamba, umba bɔkɔ o bɔkushi tee mega ɛnwu o kpolo yi mo awu. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Akwu kinzu gba ki fya ɛsɔ izɛma shɛ le, moo akwu umba mo. Kwundu uwu Ukpo gba aa mbwa nzu ma gba kii gbo Ukpo oya le ba ki mwɔnyɛ kwuwongu ikyomesu nzu mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi. Kinzu ki fulo egbo nzu mu ɛduma iyi ɛnwu mo. <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Imi mafyi mi mi yi kwuyi ungwu mi kwɛnwu mu ɛduma iyi ɛnwu tayi. Akwiyi gba onzu uwufo yi e yi ɛnwu ikwumo, Imi mi ka wu ma. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Imi o zɛ mi ɛsɔ ma ɔnuwu kwɔfyi ungworanda. o mba mi onzu uwu Izirɛ, mi wɔ mu kenzu unga Obezhami, Imi mi kwu Iburu shɛ. Mu iso iyi Ɛrama iyi Azhu imbwaluma lala, Imi mi kwu Ofarisi,<verse eid="PHP 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />mi bɔkushi nzhii ba mi lo wa mbwalu inyashi. Gba onzu ee yi ototo midu iyi Ukpo kwuwongu ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwaluma, ba mi yi ingbomo mo. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi iyi bɔkɔ mi ri kule ma yi mekyi, kekelele ba mi to yi tee akwu kiya kinyinyi fo kwuwongu Okrasi. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Akwu apula ɛnyi kɛɛkyi mo; Imi mi to apula lɛɛbi tee akwu kiya kinyinyi fo gba mi masa yi mbala iyi bɔkɔ i yi umwɔ i ka le, iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyitu iyi Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi Ɔkwu mi le. Kwuwo wu mi kala iyinayina kuleyi; mi ma yi mate akwu kwoza tayi kaa la mi fya Okrasi ma, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />kaa la mi kyomesu mbala wu. Imi mi yi ototo uwami uwu bɔkɔ o fya wu ma mu Ɛrama iyi Omosisi imbwaluma fo. Kekelele mi yi ototo kuwongwu ikwu idu lu fulo mu Okrasi, ototo uwu bɔkɔ e ngyi mbaa Ukpo ba e yi undu mu ikwu idu lu fulo. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Igyima mi gba akwu tee la mi yitu iyi Okrasi, la mi yi ekpasu iyi bɔkɔ i yi wu mo mu kwuvɔ awu, kaa la mi kyo mu inyashi imama mbala wu akwɛyi mii yi kyamate uwu tayi mu lukwu wu, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Imi mi yi eyi ifulomo te Imi tete oo yi mi mo mu kwuvɔ gba mi kpomo.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mi Bɔkushi Mi Sheye Keyi Mbaa Kiya Ingyi Bɔkɔ Mi Yi Mu Igagyima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Imi mi zɔ te mi fya ɛlɛ lɛɛbi ma-a mo nana Imi mi nyɔlɔma mu ingyinangyina-a mo. Imi mi yi mu kushi ibɔma kaa la mi fya rigbɛ, moo akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi a ŋa mi le. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, Imi mi zɔ tee mi fya rigbɛ ngyɛngyi ma-a mo; kiya kikpɛnyi gba mi yi mu iwomo le, gba i yi tee, Imi mi yese iyi kembo fo, igyikpɔɔ mi gba akwu tee la mi ba mbaa ingyi bɔkɔ ki yi mu keyi mi awu. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ Imi mi renya mi bɔ eyi shɛ mbaa bɔkɔ mi sheyimo kaa la mi fya rigbɛ ngyɛngyi ma, rigbɛ gba akwu tee Ukpo a ya mi ma iyi kwunyɔ moshi kwuwongu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, kinzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ ki kɔma mu kwundu awu i shoshi te la ki yi egbo ɛlɛ te. Akwiyi gba ba umbafo yi o yi egbo ewa meka yi, Ukpo ee shi lu zɔngɔma yi ma marimari. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Munamuna mbaa bɔkɔ ki ba-a, la ki sheyimo keyi mu ɔgwuzɛ ɔwu.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Ɛmɛnɛ mi, mi gyi tee la lu vɔngɔ munyi mi. La lu bɔ eyi mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ luzɛ mba lu zɛ kyaa mbala iyi bɔkɔ ki zɔ yi awu. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Imi mi so yi iso ɛlɛ kwuye riba riba dɛ-ɛ, mi gba mi so yi kpɔ la ɛnyɛ meyi tee: enzu gyɔɔ mu iwomo mbo i zɔ tee umba akwu agewa umba lukwu undu Okrasi mu kwuwɛyi ungwu lukwu. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />Umba imbwama mba akwu kwoba ungwu ɔyi, kwuwongu ukpo mba gba akwu ekweyi iyi ɛnwu mba le. Umba o kwɛnwu mu apula iyi lovya, akwɛyi egbo ibyima mba ba akwu mu apula iyi kwudu kwɔlɛ kɛɛkyi. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Kinzu ba ki kwu enzu umba kwogba ungwu oshi, ba ki yi mu eyi ifulomo iyi Usama nzu, Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi, uwu bɔkɔ ee ngyi moshi. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Mu ekpasu wu iyi bɔkɔ e domo te e rɛsu mu apula lɛɛbi awu, a ŋanga ɛnwu nzu iyi lukwu ɛlɛ ma akwɛyi ee wo yi mate ɛnwu iyawu iyi inzumbɛku tayi.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kaza Itama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, ɛmɛnɛ mi, umba idɛnyi mi, lu lumeyi gyɔɔ! Lunyi gba lu kwu ɔnyɛ mi mbala rigbɛ ingyi ɛduma mi le! La lu shɔɔkɔ, la lu rima gbagiri mu Ɔkwu imbwaluma.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Iyodiya mbala Ositiki, shɔɔkɔ, mi kpa yi ɛshɛku tee, la lu nyama mbala esu kwuwongu lunyi wepepoyi lu kwu umba Ɔkwu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Akwɛyi uŋɔ tete, onzu uwopo mi uwu ɛduma, mi gyi tee kaa mbwama laa eko mbɔlɛ; moo o wo ɛduma gyɔɔ iyi anu itama iyi iso iyesheshi ɛlɛ mbala mi, i kyo mbala Ɔkilɛmɛ mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba o wo ɛduma mbala mi, umba bɔkɔ ɛnyi mba i yi mu kwokpo ungwu Ukpo ungwu enzu umba o yi kwunyɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Lunyi la lu mwɔnyɛ mu Ɔkwu kwuyengwunanguna. Mi gba mi so yi kpɔ: La lu mwɔnyɛ!<verse eid="PHP 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Lunyi la lu yi egbo mɛzhi mbala uwewe. La lu lolo tee Ɔkwu a nda la igbama fo. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Lunyi la lu wo egbo gidigidi kwuwongu kiya kinyinyi mo, mu Ukpo ilɛma yi ba la lu nda Ukpo kiya ingyi lu gyi, ba la lu nda wu laa ɛnyi igbɛlɛma ma mu akɔ yi. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Akwɛyi idigbomo iyi Ukpo, iyi bɔkɔ onzu e do te a zɔngɔma yi ma mo awu, ii gbo idu yi mbala egbo yi ma kwuwongu ikyo mesu yi mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Mu imbwama yi , ɛmɛnɛ mi, la lu nyɔlɔ egbo yi ma mbala apula iyeshi iyi bɔkɔ i do iduma ma: apula iyi bɔkɔ akwiyi ongbulolo, iyi kwuyi, iyesheshi, ɛsɛsɛ, iyi o gyi yi, mbala iyi umwɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Lunyi la lu wo apula iyi bɔkɔ lu vɔngɔ munyi mi mbala iyi bɔkɔ lu na munyi mi awu, laa isisomo mi mbala apula iwomo mi. Akwɛyi Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ ee shi nzu idigbomo awu ee yi mbala yi.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Kwuwongwu Rɛshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Mi mwɔnyɛ gyɔɔ, mi gba mi gbɛlɛ Ɔkwu ɛnyi kwuwongu mizhikembo iyi kwuye gyɔɔ lu gba lu zɔ tee mi yi mu akɔ yi kpɔ. Mi zɔ tee lu lu mi afyima laa imbwama mo, lunyi lu fya kapa kaa la lu zɔ yi ma mo le bi. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Imi ba iyi mi yi mu isomo le akwu kwuwongu mi mate o lu mi afyima le mo, moo mi vɔngɔ-ɔ tee ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ mi yi ngyi ki do mi mo. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Imi mi yitu iyi rewa mbala i yi kiya ingyi kwuwo gyɔɔ. Mi vɔngɔ kwunvyeru kwɔlɛ, kaa munamuna, kwuyengwunanguna, akwiyi gba ubwu mi a nyɔlɔma naa mi yi lonzu, mi yi kiya gyɔɔ naa mi yi ngyi bwɛɛ bi, i kpomekya. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Mi do kiya ingyinangyina iwomo kwuwongu Ekpasu iyi bɔkɔ Okrasi e shi mi.<verse eid="PHP 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Lunyi ba lu wo ɔnyɛ bɔkɔ lu mbwa mi ma mu kwuyengwu inyashi mi awu. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Lunyi enzu umba Ofilipiya lu yitu kyoriri tee kwuyengwu mi lafya laa Omasedoniya kwuyengwu anu itama iyi Ilɔ Iyesheshi mu iyemo awu, lunyi kɛɛkyi gba lu kwu ɔshɔshi uwu bɔkɔ a mbwami ma le; lunyi kɛɛkyi gba lu yi mbala mi le meka iyi ɔnyɛ mi mbala ubugyi mi.<verse eid="PHP 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Moo kwuyengwu mi yi mu Otesalonika awu akwɛyi ugɔ a kpami ma lala, lu lɔma laa imbwama yi lu ka mi i pika izhi ikpɛnyi ma. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Akwu tee mi gyi tee la mi na rɛshi munyi yi le byi mo; Imi mi gyi tee rigbɛ ingyi ɛduma yi la ri kyomo le byi.<verse eid="PHP 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Mu kwuye kwɔlɛ kiya ingyi mi gyi lɛɛbi mi yi ngyi-e tabɔkɔ Ɛpafɔrɔditu a ka mi laa rɛshi yi lɛɛbi-e le. Apula iyi mi yi yi ele lala i pika igɔ mi ma. Apula ɛlɛ i yi kyamate apula iyi umbwɔ ferere laa Ukpo tayi; ɛlɛ gba akwu isabɔ iyi bɔkɔ i she laa Ukpo akwɛyi a na yi le. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Akwɛyi Ukpo mi, kwuwongu esheshi wu iyɛku, ee shi yi kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ lu gyi i zɛ mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Iduma lakwu iyi Ukpo Ete nzu iyɔkpɔɔ ba ɔkpɔɔ! Li yi tayi.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛnyi Igbɛlɛma Iyi Imbwambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Enzu umba Ukpo umba bɔkɔ o kwu umba Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi la lu gbɛlɛ mi mba ɛnyi. Ɛmɛnɛ mi umba bɔkɔ o yi munɛ mbala mi o lɔ ma tee lo gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Enzu umba Ukpo lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o yi munɛ o lɔ ma tee lo gbɛlɛ yi ɛnyi, i kyo enzu umba kwogba ugu ɔsu Osiza.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Esheshi iyi Ɔkwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>